{"id":28827,"slug":"husbands","title":"Husbands","year":1970,"country":"United States","duration":142,"spine":1029,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28827-husbands","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/78923bc7cdf6f313c2f69c4869e41bcd/jjWhLAVSs3yMPTCWDB7eRonBYK68Rv_large.jpg","description":"\nThe trailblazing independent auteur John Cassavetes pushes his raw, uncompromising emotional realism to its limit in this unflinching portrait of masculinity in crisis. Cassavetes joins Ben Gazzara and Peter Falk—both of whom would become key collaborators of the director’s—playing a trio of middle-aged Long Island family men who, following the sudden death of their close mutual friend, channel their grief into an epic, multiday bender that takes them from Manhattan to London in a desperate, debauched quest to feel alive. By turns painfully funny and woundingly perceptive, this “comedy about life, death, and freedom” (as its tagline stated) stands as perhaps the most fearless, harrowingly honest deconstruction of American manhood ever committed to film.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"John Cassavetes","slug":"john-cassavetes"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ben Gazzara","role":"Harry","slug":"ben-gazzara"},{"actor":"Peter Falk","role":"Archie","slug":"peter-falk"},{"actor":"John Cassavetes","role":"Gus","slug":"john-cassavetes"},{"actor":"Jenny Runacre","role":"Mary","slug":"jenny-runacre"},{"actor":"Jenny Lee Wright","role":"Pearl","slug":"jenny-lee-wright"},{"actor":"Noelle Kao","role":"Julie","slug":"noelle-kao"},{"actor":"John Kullers","role":"Red","slug":"john-kullers"},{"actor":"Meta Shaw Stevens","role":"Harry’s wife, Annie","slug":"meta-shaw-stevens"},{"actor":"Leola Harlow","role":"Leola","slug":"leola-harlow"},{"actor":"Delores Delmar","role":"The countess","slug":"delores-delmar"},{"actor":"Eleanor Zee","role":"Mrs. Hines","slug":"eleanor-zee"},{"actor":"Claire Malis","role":"Stuart’s wife","slug":"claire-malis"},{"actor":"Peggy Lashbro